title: invexapi
type: software
version: 0.2.1
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/samuelpinilla/invexapi"
abstract: >-
  A PyTorch toolkit for invex optimization: functions with optimality
  certificates, a rule engine that certifies combinations only through
  published theorems, and generic solvers.
